{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54729","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月如赭，莫战最爲良。\n若或不依（京本作「不依言」）须见败，客军得胜主军伤，宜且守封疆。\n（京本注：「先出客，後出主。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}